(2)在 $\Omega =\{r_1<|z|<r_2\}$和 $E = \{|z| = r_1\}$时,
取满足前述讨论的共形映射 $\varphi$如下
\begin{align*}
    \varphi: \ \Omega &\stackrel{\varphi_1}\longrightarrow 
    \left\{ \log r_1 <\Re z< \log r_2 \right\} 
    \stackrel{\varphi_2} \longrightarrow A,\\
    E  &\stackrel{\varphi_1}\longrightarrow 
    \left\{ \Re z= \log r_1\right\} 
    \stackrel{\varphi_2}\longrightarrow \{\Re z = 1\},\\
    z &\stackrel{\varphi_1}\longmapsto \log |z| 
    \stackrel{\varphi_2}\longmapsto 
    \frac{\log r_2-\log |z|}{\log r_2 - \log r_1} ,
\end{align*}
由此得到  $\omega_{\Omega}(z,E) 
= \Re\frac{\log r_2-\log z}{\log r_2 - \log r_1}
= \frac{\log r_2-\log |z|}{\log r_2 - \log r_1}$.
